<title>CROATIA: Croatia c. bank sells 197 mln bills rates flat.</title>
<headline>Croatia c. bank sells 197 mln bills rates flat.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia's central bank sold 197 million kuna ($32.7 million) in liquidity bills at a weekly auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Volume rose from 151 million kuna worth of bills last Wednesday and 35- and 91-day rates remained flat at 7.50 and 9.0 percent, respectively.</p>
<p>The bank said it had no other open market opeartions.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075 ($ = 6.015 Croatian Kuna)</p>
